e", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kaijugage2011/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 3678, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1998, "last_played": 1780451878, "avatar": "292afee690d9e9cdebd63fee841f0964f5ebceea"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game's fast-paced and electrifying gameplay is a very enjoyable experience and has many unique aspects to it that makes every run diverse. I would recommend this game for people who want a fun and rewarding experience that also gives you a challenge. The ability to choose modifiers to ramp up the difficulty to the extent that you desire is a breath of fresh air compared to the set limits of other difficulties in games.\n\nThe only annoying thing really is the amount of reused skins but even that isn't to bad because it doesn't affect gameplay at all and is said in-game to be fixed in the full release. I give this game a solid 8.5/10 and I can't wait for what the developers have planned for this game!\n\nAlso devs  REMOVE THE BARREL SKULL (jk)\n", "timestamp_created": 1765135578, "timestamp_updated": 1765135578, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.540229856967926025", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "212797316", "author": {"steamid": "76561198592504758", "personaname": "DaCabbageMan", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198592504758/", "num_games_owned": 54, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 9474, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1, "playtime_at_review": 1193, "last_played": 1789571790, "avatar": "f8a7ecc33a05eff5ebdf45a875e698c4c717fcd9"}, "language": "english", "review": "crab", "timestamp_created": 1765132952, "timestamp_updated": 1765132952, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0,